msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_4_variables.rst:18
msgid "This tutorial dives into the essentials of using variables, data types, constants, and preprocessor directives in Arduino programming, demonstrated through a traffic light simulation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_4_variables.rst:20
msgid "**Variables in Arduino**: Demonstrates how to use variables for dynamic programming in Arduino."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_4_variables.rst:21
